# Checked numeric differences for measurements and ML error metrics.
let actual be 12.
let predicted be 9.
let residual be difference between actual and predicted.
let absolute_error be absolute difference between predicted and actual.
let squared_error be squared difference between predicted and actual.
assert residual is equal to 3.
assert absolute_error is equal to 3.
assert squared_error is equal to 9.
let values be a list of 1, 2, 3.
let losses be map every value in values to (squared difference between value and 2).
assert (losses at 0) is equal to 1.
assert (losses at 1) is equal to 0.
assert (losses at 2) is equal to 1.
print "Numeric differences OK".
